The engine sound model in native/crates/engine-audio (the reference
implementation) and sim/src/audio/engineAudio.js (a port of it) follows the
approach of that project: cylinder pressure from a Wiebe heat-release law
driving a digital waveguide exhaust, through a synthesiser chain of jitter, DC
removal, differentiation, noise, convolution and levelling.

No audio recordings are used or distributed. All sound is generated.
